"code": "pv = [repair_bio(x) for x in predict(vs)]\nprint(span_f1(vt, pv))\nprint(span_errors(vt, pv))\nprint(\"akurasi token\", round(float(np.mean([a == b for g, p in zip(vt, pv) for a, b in zip(g, p)])), 4))\n"
